#, kde-format
msgid "Date and Time"
msgstr "Ji̍t-kî kap Sî-kan"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, setDateTimeAuto)
#: dateandtime.ui:61
#, kde-format
msgid "Set date and time &automatically"
msgstr "Tsū-tōng si&at-tīng ji̍t-kî kap sî-kan"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KDatePicker, cal)
#: dateandtime.ui:91
#, kde-format
msgid "Here you can change the system date's day of the month, month and year."
msgstr "Tsia ē-sái siat-tīng hē-thóng ê ji̍t-kî."

#. i18n: ectx: attribute (title), widget (QQuickWidget, timezoneViewer)
#: dateandtime.ui:140
#, kde-format
msgid "Time Zone"
msgstr "Sî-khu"

#: dtime.cpp:71
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Here you can change the system time. Click into the hours, minutes or "
"seconds field to change the relevant value, either using the up and down "
"buttons to the right or by entering a new value."
msgstr ""
"Tsia ē-sái siat-tīng hē-thóng ê sî-kan. Tiám-tsing, hun-tsing kap bió ê lân-"
"uī ē-sái tshi̍h pinn-á ê siōng-hā tshi̍h-liú lâi kái in ê ti̍t, mā ē-sái ti̍t-"
"tsiap su-ji̍p sin ê ti̍t."

#: dtime.cpp:194
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<h1>Date & Time</h1> This system settings module can be used to set the "
"system date and time. As these settings do not only affect you as a user, "
"but rather the whole system, you can only change these settings when you "
"start the System Settings as root. If you do not have the root password, but "
"feel the system time should be corrected, please contact your system "
"administrator."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Ji̍t-kî kap Sî-kan</h1> Tsit-ê hē-thóng siat-tīng bôo-tsoo sī iōng-lâi "
"siat-tīng hē-thóng ê ji̍t-kî kap sî-kan ê. In-uī tsia ê siat-tīng ē íng-hióng "
"tio̍h kui-ê hē-thóng, m̄-sī tsí-ū lí ka-kī ê iōng-tsiá, su-iàu ū kuán-lí-tsiá "
"(root) khuân-hān tsiah ē-sái kái tsia-ê siat-tīng. Nā lí bô root ê bi̍t-bé á-"
"sī bô khuân-hān m̄-koh kám-kak hē-thóng sî-kan su-iàu siu-tsìng, tio̍h tshiánn "
"kap lí ê hē-thóng kuán-lí-tsiá liân-lo̍k."

#: main.cpp:57
#, kde-format
msgid "Unable to change NTP settings"
msgstr "Bô-huat-tōo kái-piàn NTP siat-tīng"

#: main.cpp:70
#, kde-format
msgid "Unable to set current time"
msgstr "Bô-huat-tōo siat-tīng tsit-má ê sî-kan"

#: main.cpp:82
#, kde-format
msgid "Unable to set timezone"
msgstr "Bô-huat-tōo siat-tīng sî-khu"
